          "summary": "BIS working paper highlights the expansion of the traditional sovereign-bank nexus to include non-bank financial intermediaries (NBFIs).",
          "whyItMatters": "The inclusion of NBFIs in the sovereign-bank nexus introduces complex new systemic risk channels that central bankers and regulators must monitor. Finance professionals need to understand how distress can propagate between sovereigns, commercial banks, and shadow banking entities.",
